      "title": "Bondi beach shooting: Woman, 90, shot during massacre dies in hospital year after antisemitic attack",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/06/bondi-beach-shooting-woman-dies-year-after-terror-attack-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Woman was shot on 14 December 2025 during Hanukkah festival and she has been in and out of hospital since</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A woman who was shot during the Bondi beach terror attack has died in hospital almost 12 months after the massacre.</p><p>The 90-year-old woman had been in and out of hospital this year for treatment of injuries sustained during the attack on 14 December, a senior Jewish community source said on Friday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/06/bondi-beach-shooting-woman-dies-year-after-terror-attack-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-06T03:31:38"
